Package: virtcore
Version: 1.0.0~beta
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, libvirt-clients, libvirt-daemon-system, virtinst, qemu-system-x86
Maintainer: VirtCore Contributors
Description: Linux virtual machine manager
 VirtCore is a desktop interface for managing Linux virtual machines with
 QEMU/KVM and libvirt. It can create machines from local installer images
 and control their power state.
